* T-0290 frozen transcription with TI TL072/TL074/TL431 substitutions
* Source: cadet-iv-dual-ramp-generator-schematics.pdf (2 pages, Lars Larsen),
* see ../README.md for what was read and what was assumed.
*
* Part numbers below refer to schematic page 1 (horizontal channel).
* Page 2 (vertical channel) is the same circuit with these renamings:
*   U10->U9  U12->U13  U2->U5  Q1->Q2  Q3->Q4  C29 56n->C18 15u
*   R39,R42,R43,R44 -> R22,R23,R24,R25    R45->R27
*   R1,R2 -> R3,R4    R47,R48,R46,R49 -> R29,R30,R28,R31   R50->R32
*   R13,R11,R10,R26 -> R8,R7,R5,R6   D5,D6 -> D3,D4   R18,R20,R16,R15 -> R12,R14,R9,R33
*   J6,J8,J10 -> J2,J3,J4

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* ASSUMED behavioural op-amp (not a vendor macro-model).
* Single pole, slew limited by tanh on the input transconductance,
* output clamped about vsat below each rail, 25 ohm output resistance.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt OPAMP inp inn out vcc vee params: gbw=3e6 sr=13e6 a0=2e5 vsat=1.5
.param cc=1n
.param imax={sr*cc}
.param gm={2*3.14159265*gbw*cc}
B1 0 n1 I={imax}*tanh({gm}*(V(inp)-V(inn))/{imax})
C1 n1 0 {cc}
R1 n1 0 {a0/gm}
Bhi hi 0 V=V(vcc)-{vsat}-0.6
Blo lo 0 V=V(vee)+{vsat}+0.6
Dh n1 hi DCLAMP
Dl lo n1 DCLAMP
E1 o1 0 n1 0 1
Ro o1 out 25
.model DCLAMP D(Is=1e-14)
.ends OPAMP

* ASSUMED behavioural TL431: K->A current rises smoothly once V(REF,A) > 2.495 V.
* Reference input current (about 2 uA) is not modelled.
* Vendor TL431 loaded by deck: pins REF A K.


* ASSUMED discrete models (generic, not vendor files)
.model Q2N3906 PNP(Is=1.41f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=18.7 Bf=180.7 Ne=1.5 Ise=0 Ikf=80m Xtb=1.5
+ Br=4.977 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=2.5 Cjc=9.728p Mjc=.5776 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=8.063p
+ Mje=.3677 Vje=.75 Tr=33.42n Tf=179.3p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=6 Rb=10)
.model BS170 NMOS(Level=1 Vto=2.0 Kp=0.5 Rd=1 Rs=0.5 Cgso=40p Cgdo=5p)
.model DBODY D(Is=1e-12 Rs=0.1 Cjo=30p)
.model D1N5711 D(Is=1.2e-10 N=1 Rs=30 Cjo=2p Bv=70)
.model D1N4001 D(Is=14.11n N=1.984 Rs=33.89m Cjo=25.89p Bv=75)

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* -2 V reference (page 1, top left): U11 TL431 with REF tied to K, R38 from +12,
* R40 12.4K / R41 10K around U1.1 (TL072) -> -2.495*10/12.4 = -2.01 V
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt MINUS2REF vcc vee m2
R38 vcc n11 4.99k
XU11 n11 0 n11 TL431
R40 n11 n40 12.4k
R41 n40 m2 10k
XU1A 0 n40 vcc vee m2 TL072
.ends MINUS2REF

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* One ramp channel (page 1 = horizontal, page 2 = vertical).
*   syncn : the 74HC14 output (_HSYNC or _VSYNC), high = discharge
*   pos   : trimmer R1 (R3) wiper position, 0 = wiper at R2 end, 1 = wiper at U12.2 end
*   ramp  : U12.3 output = J8 (J3) ;  inv : U12.4 output = J6 (J2) ;  tri : U2.2 output = J10 (J4)
* Jacks are taken at the far side of the 499R series resistors, unloaded.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt RAMPCH vcc vee m2 syncn jramp jinv jtri params: cramp=56n pos=0.5
* reference: R39/R42 10K divider around U10 TL431 (K to +12, A to nx), R43 1K to ground
R39 vcc nref 10k
R42 nref nx 10k
R43 nx 0 1k
XU10 nref nx vcc TL431
* constant current source: U12.1 holds Q1 emitter at nx, R44 4.99K from +12
XU12A nx em vcc vee nb TL074
R44 vcc em 4.99k
Q1 col nb em Q2N3906
* timing capacitor and reset switch
C29 col 0 {cramp}
R45 syncn g 100
M3 col g 0 0 BS170
DB3 0 col DBODY
* U12.2 buffer, R1 trimmer + R2 4.99K, U12.3 buffer
XU12B col buf vcc vee buf TL074
R1T buf w {10k*(1-pos)+0.01}
R1B w r2 {10k*pos+0.01}
R2 r2 0 4.99k
XU12C w ramp vcc vee ramp TL074
* U12.4 inverter with -2 V offset: out = -ramp*(R46/R47) - (-2)*(R46/R48)
R47 ramp nd 10k
R48 m2 nd 20k
R46 nd inv 10k
XU12D 0 nd vcc vee inv TL074
R49 inv jinv 499
R50 ramp jramp 499
* U2 (LM6172) two-diode rectifier: ramp via R13 499R, -2 V via R11 2K
R13 ramp na 499
R11 m2 na 2k
R10 na nb2 1k
R26 na nc 1k
XU2A 0 na o1 vcc vee OPAMP gbw=100e6 sr=3000e6
D5 nb2 o1 D1N5711
D6 o1 nc D1N5711
R18 nc p5 499
R20 nb2 n6 1k
R16 n6 o2 1k
XU2B p5 n6 o2 vcc vee OPAMP gbw=100e6 sr=3000e6
R15 o2 jtri 499
.ends RAMPCH

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Power entry (page 2): D1/D2 1N4001 in series, ferrite beads as 0.1 ohm.
* Bus rails are ASSUMED to be exactly +12 V / -12 V.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt POWER vcc vee
VP bus_p 0 12
VN bus_n 0 -12
D1 bus_p f1 D1N4001
RFB1 f1 vcc 0.1
D2 f2 bus_n D1N4001
RFB2 vee f2 0.1
C2 vcc 0 10u
C6 vee 0 10u
.ends POWER
